on: \nB1 is the least useful tile. It's an edge tile that can only form B1-B2-B3 chow, and with only 3 B1 tiles unshown and 4 B2 tiles available, its potential is limited. Discarding B1 maintains better flexibility with my Bamboo tiles (B3-B3-B4) which can wait for B2 or B5, and preserves my Character sequence (T2-T3-T3-T4-T5) which offers multiple chow combinations.\n\nAnswer: Play B1"}
